  "notes": "{化学|かがく} is composed of ⟦{化|か}→化：noentry⟧ (change) + ⟦{学|がく}→学：09846_gaku⟧ (study).\n\nNOTE: Has the same reading as ⟦{科学|かがく}→科学：01277_kagaku⟧ (science). Context usually clarifies meaning. In speech, sometimes pronounced ばけがく to distinguish.\n\nBRANCHES:\n- ⟦{有機|ゆうき}→有機：03643_yuuki⟧{化学|かがく}: organic chemistry\n- ⟦{無機|むき}→無機：noentry⟧{化学|かがく}: inorganic chemistry\n- ⟦{生|せい}→生：noentry⟧{化学|かがく}: biochemistry\n\nCOMPOUNDS:\n- {化学|かがく}⟦{式|しき}→式：28575_shiki⟧: chemical formula\n- {化学|かがく}⟦{反応|はんのう}→反応：04812_hannou⟧: chemical reaction\n- {化学|かがく}⟦{薬品|やくひん}→薬品：11055_yakuhin⟧: chemicals",
